LineComment   "// A validate block holds a master's data checks. Its each clause runs once per"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// row: every assert inside reads the row through self, so unlike a top-level"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// assert (a compile-time, closed declaration) it is checked against each loaded"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// row. validate and each are context keywords, like record, primary, and source;"
